  <name>Liria</name>
  <summary>Browse and manage your files</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.hugomonizdorego">
    <name>Selviana DE Project</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>Liria is the file manager of the Selviana Desktop Environment (SDE). Its Home page shows the folders you pinned, your drives with how full they are, network locations and recent files. It has tabs, an address bar that also opens Windows shares and servers, search, and copies, moves, renames and deletes files, with safe copying to USB drives.</p>
    <p>Part of the Selviana Desktop Environment, developed by the Selviana DE Project.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">liria.desktop</launchable>
